  "question": {
    "text": "If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mi>&#945;</mi></msqrt></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mi>&#946;</mi></msqrt></mfrac></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;are the roots of the equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>,&nbsp;then the equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> has roots:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
