  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;has roots&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mi>&#945;</mi></msqrt></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mi>&#946;</mi></msqrt></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;&#160;&#160;&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mi>&#945;</mi></msqrt></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mi>&#946;</mi></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msqrt><mi>&#945;</mi></msqrt><msqrt><mi>&#946;</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Multiply and divide with&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math>, we get<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mfenced><mfrac><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mfenced><mfrac><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />From equations&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;&#160;&#160;&#160;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><msqrt><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></msqrt></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></msqrt></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mi>&#945;</mi></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mi>&#946;</mi></msqrt></mrow><msqrt><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></msqrt></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br />Roots are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup><mtext>&#160;and&#160;</mtext><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></math>.</p>"
  }
